<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<title>Activity | HeartCode Admin</title>
</head>
<body data-page="activity">
<div class="admin-shell">
  <%- include('../partials/nav', { activePage: 'activity' }) %>
  <main class="admin-main">
    <section class="admin-page-intro">
      <div>
        <p class="admin-eyebrow">Commerce</p>
        <h1>Activity</h1>
        <p>A running log of what's happened across HeartCode: payments, deployments, emails, admin recoveries, and configuration changes.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="admin-callout">
      This only shows what the app can currently detect as a structured event — it isn't a complete audit log of every admin action, and a
      deployment that never completed (an unpaid checkout, a failed Cloudflare/ClarityHeart call) won't appear here yet.
    </div>

    <section class="admin-card">
      <div class="admin-section-heading">
        <div><p class="admin-eyebrow">Feed</p><h2>Recent activity</h2></div>
        <select class="admin-select" id="activityTypeFilter" aria-label="Filter by event type">
          <option value="">All activity</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div id="activityList" class="admin-entry-list" aria-live="polite"></div>

      <div class="admin-pagination">
        <p id="activityPageInfo"></p>
        <div class="admin-pagination-controls">
          <button type="button" id="activityRefresh" class="admin-btn-outline admin-btn-sm">Refresh</button>
          <button type="button" id="activityPrev" class="admin-btn-outline admin-btn-sm">← Previous</button>
          <button type="button" id="activityNext" class="admin-btn-outline admin-btn-sm">Next →</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</div>
</body>
</html>
